 begin="03:22.853" end="03:23.135">ra</span><span begin="03:23.135" end="03:23.417">no</span><span begin="03:23.417" end="03:24.112">koe</span></text><text for="L36"><span begin="03:24.356" end="03:25.483">aimuaruuzaa</span><span begin="03:25.483" end="03:25.872">zutto</span><span begin="03:25.872" end="03:26.027">mae</span><span begin="03:26.027" end="03:26.338">kara</span><span begin="03:26.338" end="03:27.168">kikoe</span><span begin="03:27.168" end="03:27.788">teta</span></text><text for="L37"><span begin="03:27.800" end="03:28.617">itsu</span><span begin="03:28.617" end="03:29.081">ka</span><span begin="03:29.081" end="03:29.757">poketto</span><span begin="03:29.757" end="03:30.125">ni</span><span begin="03:30.125" end="03:31.211">kakushita</span><span begin="03:31.211" end="03:31.622">koe</span><span begin="03:31.622" end="03:32.168">ga</span></text><text for="L38"><span begin="03:34.108" end="03:34.408">koko</span><span begin="03:34.408" end="03:34.709">ira</span><span begin="03:34.709" end="03:34.859">de</span><span begin="03:34.859" end="03:35.178">hito</span><span begin="03:35.178" end="03:35.338">tsu</span><span begin="03:35.338" end="03:35.982">odotemiyou</span><span begin="03:35.982" end="03:36.618">ze</span><span begin="03:38.079" end="03:38.181">yoru</span><span begin="03:38.181" end="03:38.283">ga</span><span begin="03:38.283" end="03:38.758">akeru</span><span begin="03:38.758" end="03:38.938">made</span><span begin="03:38.938" end="03:39.922">korogateikou</span><span begin="03:39.922" end="03:40.564">ze</span></text><text for="L39"><span begin="03:42.105" end="03:42.502">kikoe</span><span begin="03:42.502" end="03:42.767">ten</span><span begin="03:42.767" end="03:43.032">nara</span><span begin="03:43.032" end="03:43.238">koe</span><span begin="03:43.238" end="03:43.476">dashi</span><span begin="03:43.476" end="03:43.864">teikou</span><span begin="03:43.864" end="03:47.885">ze</span></text></transliteration></transliterations><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-CN"><text for="L1">老样子走在老路上独自一人 这种日子早就过够了</text><text for="L2">明明哪里都去不了 还是做梦道晚安</text><text for="L3">我们总这样对昏沉的夜晚腻到不行</text><text for="L4">为了遇见再次起舞的明天 就此告别</text><text for="L5">四处游荡终于到了 这里算乐园吗</text><text for="L6">事到如今我也说不清了</text><text for="L7">四分之一世纪熬出个苍白明星 饿着肚子还在等</text><text for="L8">我是输家 既然如此纵情嚎叫又何妨</text><text for="L9">再来一次再来一次 让我们的声音响起来</text><text for="L10">我是输家 那声音从很久以前就听得见</text><text for="L11">曾经藏进口袋里的那个声音</text><text for="L12">谁在乎别人闲话 前方天空风雨欲来</text><text for="L13">窗外探头的那座摩天楼 看我们不过像尘埃</text><text for="L14">伊恩和科特也早已成为过去 竖中指也没用</text><text for="L15">现在要学的是怎么赢 还要挂上开朗的表情</text><text for="L16">跳舞的傻瓜和旁观的傻瓜 我们是从旁笑话他们的傻瓜</text><text for="L17">把膨胀的自我抱在怀里 磨到最后只剩酸葡萄</text><text for="L18">抱着膝盖也没用 长刘海把前路遮得看不见</text><text for="L19">这骤然燃起又飘然散去的轮回真让人发笑</text><text for="L20">想被爱就直说啊 光在心里想是传不到的</text><text for="L21">永远的淑女也转过脸 天堂在更远的那一头</text><text for="L22">啊我懂 摔到谷底的我是条败犬</text><text for="L23">无论哪里都好我只想去远方 仅此而已</text><text for="L24">仔细听别错过此刻在远处响起的那个声音 调匀呼吸</text><text for="L25">终会遇见的那颗金色的堇青石 握紧别放手</text><text for="L26">我是输家 反正一无所有怎样都无所谓</text><text for="L27">再磨蹭晃荡下去迟早成灰 就此别过</text><text for="L28">我是输家 只是祈祷着总有一天</text><text for="L29">继续走 走进加时赛的更深处</text><text for="L30">想被爱就直说啊 光在心里想是传不到的</text><text for="L31">永远的淑女也转过脸 天堂在更远的那一头</text><text for="L32">来跳一支舞吧 滚到天亮</text><text for="L33">既然听得见 就大声喊出来</text><text for="L34">我是输家 既然如此纵情嚎叫又何妨</text><text for="L35">再来一次再来一次 让我们的声音响起来</text><text for="L36">我是输家 那声音从很久以前就听得见</text><text for="L37">曾经藏进口袋里的那个声音</text><text for="L38">来跳一支舞吧 滚到天亮</text><text for="L39">既然听得见 就大声喊出来</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="03:47.885"><div begin="00:29.805" end="00:59.739" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="00:29.805" end="00:33.493" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:29.805" end="00:30.155">いつ</span><span begin="00:30.155" end="00:30.330">も</span><span begin="00:30.330" end="00:30.638">どおり</span><span begin="00:30.638" end="00:30.740">の</span><span begin="00: